---
import { Banner } from "@/components/Banner";
import { PageBreadcrumb } from "@/components/PageBreadcrumb";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Our Mission | Cicada Cinema">
  <Banner />
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-6">
    <PageBreadcrumb items={[{ label: "Our Mission" }]} />
  </div>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Our Mission</h1>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      Cicada Cinema is a nonprofit movie theater in Bloomington, IN. Our mission
      is to provide high-quality screenings of underrepresented cinema - the
      old, the new, and the locally created. Volunteer run and community driven,
      Cicada Cinema aims to create an independent space for film and film
      lovers.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">About Cicada Cinema</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">
      Cicada Cinema is a volunteer run 501(c)(3) non profit movie theater
      located in beautiful Bloomington, Indiana. Cicada Cinema was started by
      five Bloomington volunteers at the much-missed warehouse venue The Void on
      Halloween 2016. When The Void became…well…a void, Cicada rolled with the
      punches and began “popping up” across town, showing movies anywhere we
      could fit a screen and speakers. We've screened films at the Orbit Room,
      the Back Door, Hopscotch Coffee, the FAR Center for Contemporary Arts, and
      more, and thanks to support from our many community partners, 67 of those
      films have been completely free to the public! For nearly ten years, we
      schlepped our equipment across town hundreds of times, supported all the
      while by Bloomington's knowledgeable, curious, and generous film
      community. Now, we are working on our next big project - a brick and
      mortar movie house. Cicada Cinema will be located right off the B-Line at
      615 N Fairview, Suite 1 right next door to our friends at Friendly Beasts.
      We are currently in the buildout phase, and hope to open in January 2027.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
